error[8-0037]: effect `Writer` must be mutable when calling `write`
   ┌─ trait_effect_rebinding.fe:24:30
   │
24 │     with (Writer = writer) { write() }
   │                    ------    ^^^^^^^ `write` requires `mut Writer`
   │                    │
   │                    effect `Writer` is provided here
   │
   = use a mutable binding or pass a mutable reference in the `with` block

